 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored from the archived crops: panel 30 (Nida Senffstraat SE, 53.5 m) from w01-131 2022-01-17, 17 bays, the eight-storey tower as its own house over bays 12-16; panel 0 (N, 49 m) from w02-13L 2020-02-03; panel 48 (W, 46 m) from w03-271L 2019-12-10, balcony soffits and jamb panels in timber; panel 53 (NE, 33 m) from w04-41 2025-09-25 (tree in front), the Albert Heijn glazed plinth. Courtyard panels have no crop and take otherWalls.",
  "The cantilever slabs are balconyBands spans at the kit's deepest (0.7 of a storey, about 2.2 m); the photo's slabs are about 2.5-3 m deep and slightly splayed, not modelled."
